sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Python Code
    participant TC as TrainerClient
    participant KB as KubernetesBackend
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as Trainer Operator
    participant Pod as Training Pod
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: Flow 1: Training Job Submission (Kubernetes Backend)
    User->>TC: create(trainer, config)
    TC->>KB: dispatch (KubernetesBackendConfig)
    KB->>K8s: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8s-->>KB: TrainJob created
    K8s->>Operator: Watch event (reconcile)
    Operator->>K8s: Create JobSet + Pods
    K8s-->>Pod: Schedule & Run

    Note over User,S3: Flow 2: RHAI TransformersTrainer with Checkpointing
    User->>TC: create(TransformersTrainer, config)
    TC->>KB: dispatch with injected code<br/>(inspect.getsource serialization)
    KB->>K8s: POST TrainJob CR<br/>with progression annotations<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8s->>Operator: Watch event (reconcile)
    Operator->>K8s: Create Pods with<br/>injected checkpoint code
    K8s-->>Pod: Schedule & Run
    Pod->>S3: Async checkpoint upload<br/>Auth: AWS IAM/Access Keys
    S3-->>Pod: Upload confirmed
    Pod->>K8s: PATCH annotations<br/>trainer.opendatahub.io/progression-*<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over User,S3: Flow 3: Container Backend (Local Development)
    participant CB as ContainerBackend
    participant Docker as Docker/Podman<br/>Unix Socket

    User->>TC: create(trainer, ContainerBackendConfig)
    TC->>CB: dispatch
    CB->>Docker: Create container(s)<br/>Auth: None
    Docker-->>CB: Container started
    CB-->>TC: Training running locally
